<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Contact | Job Portal</title><%@include file="all_component/all_css.jsp"%></head><body>
<%@include file="all_component/navbar.jsp"%>
<div class="page-header"><div class="container"><div class="section-kicker">Contact</div><h1>Have a question?</h1><p>Use the details below for project or portal enquiries.</p></div></div>
<main class="container section-space"><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="form-card"><div class="section-kicker">Send a message</div><h2 class="form-card-title mt-2">Contact form</h2><p class="form-card-subtitle">This form is presented as part of the portal interface.</p><form onsubmit="return false"><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">Name</label><input class="form-control" type="text" placeholder="Your name"></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">Email</label><input class="form-control" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com"></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label">Message</label><textarea class="form-control" rows="6" placeholder="How can we help?"></textarea></div><button type="submit" class="btn btn-jp-primary" onclick="alert('Thanks. This contact form is currently a front-end demo.');">Send Message</button></form></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="feature-card h-100"><div class="section-kicker">Portal support</div><h2 class="section-title h4 mt-2">Job Portal</h2><p class="muted-text mt-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope me-2"></i>support@jobportal.local</p><p class="muted-text"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot me-2"></i>Pune, Maharashtra</p><hr><p class="small muted-text mb-0">For the engineering project, the contact form is intentionally kept lightweight and does not alter the existing database workflow.</p></div></div></div></main><%@include file="all_component/footer.jsp"%></body></html>
